{
  "level": 3,
  "lesson": 2,
  "items": [
    {
      "bodySourceId": "hsk3-official-body:l02:text1:line01",
      "sourcePointer": "/bodyChineseOnlyTexts/0",
      "verdict": "accepted",
      "sourceBodyKind": "role-dialogue-line",
      "pdfPage": 23,
      "printedPage": 11,
      "printedRoleZh": "王一雪",
      "zhPrinted": "家月、李文，你们看看菜单，想吃点儿什么？",
      "appendixSourceIds": [
        "hsk3-official-vi:l02:p183:appendix-text1-role01"
      ],
      "sourceRecordSHA256": "8aed900a0755dcf42ea0c3dc1b69317ef4236d025d24fb87f52c9a1f8a80e286",
      "bodyVietnameseAbsent": true,
      "actualChineseAndAppendixRoleCorrespondenceVisuallyChecked": true,
      "websiteLinePartitionNotInferred": true
    },
    {
      "bodySourceId": "hsk3-official-body:l02:text1:line02",
      "sourcePointer": "/bodyChineseOnlyTexts/1",
      "verdict": "accepted",
      "sourceBodyKind": "role-dialogue-line",
      "pdfPage": 23,
      "printedPage": 11,
      "printedRoleZh": "李文",
      "zhPrinted": "谢谢一雪姐，我都可以，你们点吧。",
      "appendixSourceIds": [
        "hsk3-official-vi:l02:p183:appendix-text1-role02"
      ],
      "sourceRecordSHA256": "e5540d75f86c1306d5aa3ff255c00e923713c695817bbee5a2b57b13cf984918",
      "bodyVietnameseAbsent": true,
      "actualChineseAndAppendixRoleCorrespondenceVisuallyChecked": true,
      "websiteLinePartitionNotInferred": true
    },
    {
      "bodySourceId": "hsk3-official-body:l02:text1:line03",
      "sourcePointer": "/bodyChineseOnlyTexts/2",
      "verdict": "accepted",
      "sourceBodyKind": "role-dialogue-line",
      "pdfPage": 23,
      "printedPage": 11,
      "printedRoleZh": "白家月",
      "zhPrinted": "飞了这么远，现在还真是又饿又渴。",
      "appendixSourceIds": [
        "hsk3-official-vi:l02:p184:appendix-text1-role03"
      ],
      "sourceRecordSHA256": "b9954d55fdd554d1f38eba220c248f5810c276270347ecae266ff1f623b7f0d1",
      "bodyVietnameseAbsent": true,
      "actualChineseAndAppendixRoleCorrespondenceVisuallyChecked": true,
      "websiteLinePartitionNotInferred": true
    },
    {
      "bodySourceId": "hsk3-official-body:l02:text1:line04",
      "sourcePointer": "/bodyChineseOnlyTexts/3",
      "verdict": "accepted",
      "sourceBodyKind": "role-dialogue-line",
      "pdfPage": 23,
      "printedPage": 11,
      "printedRoleZh": "王一雪",
      "zhPrinted": "那多点点儿，别客气。你们喝什么饮料？",
      "appendixSourceIds": [
        "hsk3-official-vi:l02:p184:appendix-text1-role04"
      ],
      "sourceRecordSHA256": "f3099ab6d57816c9ca768bb24fe7366c98e10ce4af4de9f012ba9418607969c4",
      "bodyVietnameseAbsent": true,
      "actualChineseAndAppendixRoleCorrespondenceVisuallyChecked": true,
      "websiteLinePartitionNotInferred": true
    },
    {
      "bodySourceId": "hsk3-official-body:l02:text1:line05",
      "sourcePointer": "/bodyChineseOnlyTexts/4",
      "verdict": "accepted",
      "sourceBodyKind": "role-dialogue-line",
      "pdfPage": 23,
      "printedPage": 11,
      "printedRoleZh": "白家月",
      "zhPrinted": "好久没喝中国茶，也好久没吃饺子了。我想喝绿茶、吃饺子，可以吗？",
      "appendixSourceIds": [
        "hsk3-official-vi:l02:p184:appendix-text1-role05"
      ],
      "sourceRecordSHA256": "d716fea3a96e6e858e0a361f43afde741f0161d7de59471874dd17cc59e673e2",
      "bodyVietnameseAbsent": true,
      "actualChineseAndAppendixRoleCorrespondenceVisuallyChecked": true,
      "websiteLinePartitionNotInferred": true
    },
    {
      "bodySourceId": "hsk3-official-body:l02:text1:line06",
      "sourcePointer": "/bodyChineseOnlyTexts/5",
      "verdict": "accepted",
      "sourceBodyKind": "role-dialogue-line",
      "pdfPage": 23,
      "printedPage": 11,
      "printedRoleZh": "王一雪",
      "zhPrinted": "没问题。你们看看还想吃什么。",
      "appendixSourceIds": [
        "hsk3-official-vi:l02:p184:appendix-text1-role06"
      ],
      "sourceRecordSHA256": "c02237d1d0507a0b4eaf4126ea2db5c86e1c420a798cd581eb2dab3c8dfca4a0",
      "bodyVietnameseAbsent": true,
      "actualChineseAndAppendixRoleCorrespondenceVisuallyChecked": true,
      "websiteLinePartitionNotInferred": true
    },
    {
      "bodySourceId": "hsk3-official-body:l02:text2:line01",
      "sourcePointer": "/bodyChineseOnlyTexts/6",
      "verdict": "accepted",
      "sourceBodyKind": "role-dialogue-line",
      "pdfPage": 25,
      "printedPage": 13,
      "printedRoleZh": "王一雪",
      "zhPrinted": "服务员，再给我们拿一双筷子、一个勺子和一个碗。",
      "appendixSourceIds": [
        "hsk3-official-vi:l02:p184:appendix-text2-role01"
      ],
      "sourceRecordSHA256": "051424c4cdbd0f26b07443f70f98b775ce171e5d499a50b27a8f68fd5966bc74",
      "bodyVietnameseAbsent": true,
      "actualChineseAndAppendixRoleCorrespondenceVisuallyChecked": true,
      "websiteLinePartitionNotInferred": true
    },
    {
      "bodySourceId": "hsk3-official-body:l02:text2:line02",
      "sourcePointer": "/bodyChineseOnlyTexts/7",
      "verdict": "accepted",
      "sourceBodyKind": "role-dialogue-line",
      "pdfPage": 25,
      "printedPage": 13,
      "printedRoleZh": "服务员",
      "zhPrinted": "好的，请等一下，我马上去拿。",
      "appendixSourceIds": [
        "hsk3-official-vi:l02:p184:appendix-text2-role02"
      ],
      "sourceRecordSHA256": "51aed7b029213d139e3ebdd0794c9d9455f1ed4393cb1b30db1b866013bac6d5",
      "bodyVietnameseAbsent": true,
      "actualChineseAndAppendixRoleCorrespondenceVisuallyChecked": true,
      "websiteLinePartitionNotInferred": true
    },
    {
      "bodySourceId": "hsk3-official-body:l02:text2:line03",
      "sourcePointer": "/bodyChineseOnlyTexts/8",
      "verdict": "accepted",
      "sourceBodyKind": "role-dialogue-line",
      "pdfPage": 25,
      "printedPage": 13,
      "printedRoleZh": "王一雪",
      "zhPrinted": "这家饭馆的服务很热情，菜也都做得很好吃。你们尝尝，看喜不喜欢这些菜。",
      "appendixSourceIds": [
        "hsk3-official-vi:l02:p184:appendix-text2-role03"
      ],
      "sourceRecordSHA256": "4003a0ba056f67f91e8d361b0669858088f96a39d7e89668541891697ca1130d",
      "bodyVietnameseAbsent": true,
      "actualChineseAndAppendixRoleCorrespondenceVisuallyChecked": true,
      "websiteLinePartitionNotInferred": true
    },
    {
      "bodySourceId": "hsk3-official-body:l02:text2:line04",
      "sourcePointer": "/bodyChineseOnlyTexts/9",
      "verdict": "accepted",
      "sourceBodyKind": "role-dialogue-line",
      "pdfPage": 25,
      "printedPage": 13,
      "printedRoleZh": "白家月",
      "zhPrinted": "哪个菜都好吃。您点的这些菜真不错。",
      "appendixSourceIds": [
        "hsk3-official-vi:l02:p184:appendix-text2-role04"
      ],
      "sourceRecordSHA256": "41cd05cf8f2f4bf7f4a683d8d93bd411af62818a6b08bdb88fea6061268cfca8",
      "bodyVietnameseAbsent": true,
      "actualChineseAndAppendixRoleCorrespondenceVisuallyChecked": true,
      "websiteLinePartitionNotInferred": true
    },
    {
      "bodySourceId": "hsk3-official-body:l02:text2:line05",
      "sourcePointer": "/bodyChineseOnlyTexts/10",
      "verdict": "accepted",
      "sourceBodyKind": "role-dialogue-line",
      "pdfPage": 25,
      "printedPage": 13,
      "printedRoleZh": "王一雪",
      "zhPrinted": "这里的饭菜又便宜又好吃，我们经常来，服务员都记住我们爱吃的菜了。",
      "appendixSourceIds": [
        "hsk3-official-vi:l02:p184:appendix-text2-role05"
      ],
      "sourceRecordSHA256": "2e971d7b26278144797fc333b7d420908e4bca4edd40fc7fbd79a7e0e83c30aa",
      "bodyVietnameseAbsent": true,
      "actualChineseAndAppendixRoleCorrespondenceVisuallyChecked": true,
      "websiteLinePartitionNotInferred": true
    },
    {
      "bodySourceId": "hsk3-official-body:l02:text2:line06",
      "sourcePointer": "/bodyChineseOnlyTexts/11",
      "verdict": "accepted",
      "sourceBodyKind": "role-dialogue-line",
      "pdfPage": 25,
      "printedPage": 13,
      "printedRoleZh": "服务员",
      "zhPrinted": "王姐，您经常来吃饭，今天送您一些水果，请慢用。",
      "appendixSourceIds": [
        "hsk3-official-vi:l02:p184:appendix-text2-role06"
      ],
      "sourceRecordSHA256": "b703eea160d4f75bc3c28f044888e24222fe3aaff40f59fd40ff955a8bc9d2d8",
      "bodyVietnameseAbsent": true,
      "actualChineseAndAppendixRoleCorrespondenceVisuallyChecked": true,
      "websiteLinePartitionNotInferred": true
    },
    {
      "bodySourceId": "hsk3-official-body:l02:text3:line01",
      "sourcePointer": "/bodyChineseOnlyTexts/12",
      "verdict": "accepted",
      "sourceBodyKind": "role-dialogue-line",
      "pdfPage": 26,
      "printedPage": 14,
      "printedRoleZh": "白家月",
      "zhPrinted": "这个鸡肉饭太好吃了，我要再来吃一次。",
      "appendixSourceIds": [
        "hsk3-official-vi:l02:p184:appendix-text3-role01"
      ],
      "sourceRecordSHA256": "86c89133c7130798d025d288ba9c57870cf6c45469a4c7802d67afe004f88e80",
      "bodyVietnameseAbsent": true,
      "actualChineseAndAppendixRoleCorrespondenceVisuallyChecked": true,
      "websiteLinePartitionNotInferred": true
    },
    {
      "bodySourceId": "hsk3-official-body:l02:text3:line02",
      "sourcePointer": "/bodyChineseOnlyTexts/13",
      "verdict": "accepted",
      "sourceBodyKind": "role-dialogue-line",
      "pdfPage": 26,
      "printedPage": 14,
      "printedRoleZh": "李文",
      "zhPrinted": "你可以拿走这张菜单，看看下次还吃点儿什么。",
      "appendixSourceIds": [
        "hsk3-official-vi:l02:p184:appendix-text3-role02"
      ],
      "sourceRecordSHA256": "fd9a0842563d9ddabd732a7b75664677e91f8532a740470320d62a3a24af363a",
      "bodyVietnameseAbsent": true,
      "actualChineseAndAppendixRoleCorrespondenceVisuallyChecked": true,
      "websiteLinePartitionNotInferred": true
    },
    {
      "bodySourceId": "hsk3-official-body:l02:text3:line03",
      "sourcePointer": "/bodyChineseOnlyTexts/14",
      "verdict": "accepted",
      "sourceBodyKind": "role-dialogue-line",
      "pdfPage": 26,
      "printedPage": 14,
      "printedRoleZh": "王一雪",
      "zhPrinted": "不用拿菜单，在手机上就能看到，也可以选好了让他们给你送。",
      "appendixSourceIds": [
        "hsk3-official-vi:l02:p184:appendix-text3-role03"
      ],
      "sourceRecordSHA256": "5c52fd0ba38f3e4505f090f5f2933c00a5073d2b63ef91a8ddb3c05261ce16f8",
      "bodyVietnameseAbsent": true,
      "actualChineseAndAppendixRoleCorrespondenceVisuallyChecked": true,
      "websiteLinePartitionNotInferred": true
    },
    {
      "bodySourceId": "hsk3-official-body:l02:text3:line04",
      "sourcePointer": "/bodyChineseOnlyTexts/15",
      "verdict": "accepted",
      "sourceBodyKind": "role-dialogue-line",
      "pdfPage": 26,
      "printedPage": 14,
      "printedRoleZh": "白家月",
      "zhPrinted": "他们家还能送外卖？",
      "appendixSourceIds": [
        "hsk3-official-vi:l02:p184:appendix-text3-role04"
      ],
      "sourceRecordSHA256": "d7df738cfbde1ef2ae160a79ba20cdfaa2ac91fd004c8373f2e7d0028b2773d0",
      "bodyVietnameseAbsent": true,
      "actualChineseAndAppendixRoleCorrespondenceVisuallyChecked": true,
      "websiteLinePartitionNotInferred": true
    },
    {
      "bodySourceId": "hsk3-official-body:l02:text3:line05",
      "sourcePointer": "/bodyChineseOnlyTexts/16",
      "verdict": "accepted",
      "sourceBodyKind": "role-dialogue-line",
      "pdfPage": 26,
      "printedPage": 14,
      "printedRoleZh": "王一雪",
      "zhPrinted": "对，现在很多饭馆都能送外卖，想吃什么就点什么。",
      "appendixSourceIds": [
        "hsk3-official-vi:l02:p184:appendix-text3-role05"
      ],
      "sourceRecordSHA256": "bf38ddf0070b944147f0d741a74d4a740332a443e4bb06a5a8f1dd5fb8b9feda",
      "bodyVietnameseAbsent": true,
      "actualChineseAndAppendixRoleCorrespondenceVisuallyChecked": true,
      "websiteLinePartitionNotInferred": true
    },
    {
      "bodySourceId": "hsk3-official-body:l02:text3:line06",
      "sourcePointer": "/bodyChineseOnlyTexts/17",
      "verdict": "accepted",
      "sourceBodyKind": "role-dialogue-line",
      "pdfPage": 26,
      "printedPage": 14,
      "printedRoleZh": "白家月",
      "zhPrinted": "那真是太方便了！",
      "appendixSourceIds": [
        "hsk3-official-vi:l02:p184:appendix-text3-role06"
      ],
      "sourceRecordSHA256": "32596aed2e5b8bbee87a9d1e28e5ef74bcdcf7541fa46499770a775cac64ba30",
      "bodyVietnameseAbsent": true,
      "actualChineseAndAppendixRoleCorrespondenceVisuallyChecked": true,
      "websiteLinePartitionNotInferred": true
    },
    {
      "bodySourceId": "hsk3-official-body:l02:text4:line01",
      "sourcePointer": "/bodyChineseOnlyTexts/18",
      "verdict": "accepted",
      "sourceBodyKind": "whole-unlabelled-paragraph",
      "pdfPage": 28,
      "printedPage": 16,
      "printedRoleZh": null,
      "zhPrinted": "这些年在国外，我很少自己做饭。早饭我吃一个面包，有时候吃一块蛋糕，再喝一杯咖啡。午饭和晚饭也都在外面吃。快要考试的时候又忙又累，没时间出去吃饭，家里又什么吃的都没有，我可能好几天只吃方便面。现在回到中国了，每天能吃到妈妈做的饭，我真是太高兴了！有时候妈妈只做几个简单的菜，我也非常爱吃，因为什么都没有妈妈做的饭好吃。",
      "appendixSourceIds": [
        "hsk3-official-vi:l02:p184:appendix-text4-whole-paragraph"
      ],
      "sourceRecordSHA256": "275d6357b002a60ef75a88eb9c82987eedc7c682e4bfbe100ec1bf8d362b171d",
      "bodyVietnameseAbsent": true,
      "actualChineseAndAppendixRoleCorrespondenceVisuallyChecked": true,
      "websiteLinePartitionNotInferred": true
    }
  ]
}
